triton 3.8.0, torch 2.11.0+cu130, NVIDIA H200 NVL, Python 3.13.9
E1. a conditional expression with a runtime condition
  E1a (-1 if c > 0 else -3) // 2: c = 5 -> 0, c = -5 -> -1 (Python's floor division: -1, -2)
  E1b x * (0.1 if c > 0 else ...) with c = 5, on all 65280 finite bfloat16 x: 0 differ from the float32 product rounded to bfloat16, 13076 differ from the bfloat16 product
  E1b x * (0.2 if c > 0 else ...) with c = -5, on all 65280 finite bfloat16 x: 0 differ from the float32 product rounded to bfloat16, 13102 differ from the bfloat16 product
  E1c 1 if c > 0 else 1.0: rejected on the host (CompilationError); x if c > 0 else 1.0 (int32 x): rejected on the host (CompilationError)
  E1d x + 1 if c > 0 else x - 1 (int32 x = 7): c = 5 -> 8, c = -5 -> 6
E2. a helper's returns
  E2a return -7 / return -9; h(c) // 2: c = 5 -> -3, c = -5 -> -4 (Python: -4, -5)
  E2b return 1 / return 1.0; x * h(c), x = 2^24 + 1: c = 5 -> 16777217, c = -5 -> 16777217 (Python: 16777217, 16777216)
